    <string name="faq_titulo">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</string>
    <string name="faq_subtitulo">How can we help you?</string>

    <string name="faq_q1">How can I send a Bizum?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">To send a Bizum, access the \"Bizum\" section from the main menu, select \"Send money\", enter the contact and the desired amount (between €0.5 and €500) and press \"Confirm\".</string>

    <string name="faq_q2">What is my transfer limit?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">The minimum amount for a transfer is €10 and the maximum allowed per operation is €10,000.</string>

    <string name="faq_q3">How do I change my password?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">You can change your password in the \"Security\" section of the user menu. Remember it must be at least 7 digits long.</string>

    <string name="faq_q4">I forgot my password, what should I do?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">On the login screen, tap on \"Forgot your password?\". Enter your NIF and we will send a recovery link to your email.</string>

    <string name="faq_q5">Is biometric access safe?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Yes, fingerprint or facial recognition access uses Android security standards to ensure only you can access your accounts.</string>

    <string name="faq_q6">Where can I find the nearest ATM?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Use the \"ATM Map\" option in the menu. Remember to turn on geolocation permission to see offices near your current position.</string>

    <string name="faq_q7">How do I contact technical support?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">You can call us at the free numbers listed in \"Contact Us\" or use the help chat available on most screens.</string>
